The texts in this repository are the Folger Shakespeare digital editions,
published by the Folger Shakespeare Library and edited by Barbara A. Mowat and
Paul Werstine, with Michael Poston and Rebecca Niles.

    https://shakespeare.folger.edu/shakespeares-works/

They are redistributed here unchanged, under the licence the Folger publishes
them with:

    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 3.0 Unported (CC BY-NC 3.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0/

You may copy, share and adapt them for non-commercial purposes, provided you
credit Folger Shakespeare (Folger Digital Texts) as the source, link to the
licence, and say whether you changed the content. Commercial use needs the
Folger's permission: editions@folger.edu. See
https://www.folger.edu/copyright-policy/ for the full terms.

The README and the file layout in this repository carry no separate
restriction; use them as you like.
